      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "A June morning",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Just after",
            "accent": "sunrise."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Nilsa booked only a couple of days before we met. We photographed on 20 June, when sunrise comes very early on the coast.",
            "At first they struck me as serious and well prepared for the shoot. They had set off by car while it was still dark, but even at that hour the morning traffic had other plans. They reached Amalfi a little after sunrise. We still made some lovely photographs."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spreads",
      "eyebrow": "02 / Along the coast",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "From the harbour",
