      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Along the coast",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "From the harbour",
            "accent": "to Atrani."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "We began by the harbour, near the large car park, and followed the coast towards Atrani. It was a good morning on a route I know well. Afterwards, as always, I shared my Amalfi Coast guide with them, just as I do with everyone who comes for a photoshoot.",
            "This morning is another reason I often talk about starting early. I am a perfectionist about photographs. In bright Amalfi sunshine, pictures feel hot and wonderfully summery, almost as though they were made on film. That is a lovely effect, too."
          ],
          "links": [
            {
              "label": "My Amalfi Coast guide",
              "href": "https://guide.amalfi.day"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
