        "cnr2307"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Time to find the moment",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "A little earlier,",
            "accent": "a little more time."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "My own preference is for modern digital photography. I like the freedom to make thousands of frames, as I did during this shoot, and look for the best moments among them. For that, I want both enough time and the right light.",
            "I always ask guests to meet as early as they can, ideally a couple of minutes before sunrise. Then we have time to begin calmly, walk through the places we have chosen and enjoy the morning light before the sun becomes really strong."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
