  "dateTime": "2026-06-20",
  "review": {
    "author": "Nilsa O",
    "authorDetail": "United States · 26 June 2026",
    "rating": 5,
    "paragraphs": [
      "Gregory was super helpful and flexible. My husband and I were doing a post wedding photoshoot, he gave us suggestions, was flexible, super friendly and easy to communicate with. He sent us some of the pictures right away, so we could see the editing and picture quality. Our pictures were beautiful and he walked Amalfi coast with us to find the best spots for pictures. I recommend him 100% Book him! Nilsa O"
    ],
